          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_02",
      "hash64": "23D036958FE33AD7",
      "text": "Have you come out here to the schoolyard for\\nsome training?![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_03a",
      "hash64": "BE0452237F1A503F",
      "text": "Aha! I knew I could see a fighting spirit burning\\nbehind those eyes of yours![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_03b",
      "hash64": "BE0453237F1A51F2",
      "text": "Ah! Sorry. That was a little rude of me to ask.\\nI know the point of training isn’t to show off in\\r\\nfront of other people.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_04",
      "hash64": "23D034958FE33771",
      "text": "Why don’t we do a bit of running together here\\nto get to know each other a little better?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_05",
      "hash64": "23D033958FE335BE",
      "text": "Ready? Let’s go![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_system_01",
      "hash64": "5CE62BAF22FB929E",
      "text": "You ran three laps around the schoolyard with\\nMs. Dendra...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_06",
      "hash64": "23D032958FE3340B",
      "text": "Phew! That really worked up a nice sweat![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_07",
      "hash64": "23D031958FE33258",
      "text": "You’ve got a good pair of legs on ya, new kid![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_08",
      "hash64": "23D030958FE330A5",
      "text": "A good bout of training sure does make a body\\nhungry, doesn’t it?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_09",
      "hash64": "23D02F958FE32EF2",
      "text": "I’ll let you have one of my homemade\\nsandwiches as my way of saying thanks for\\r\\nrunning with me today! Feed those muscles![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_system_02",
      "hash64": "5CE62AAF22FB90EB",
      "text": "Ms. Dendra’s sandwich was dry and had an odd\\nsmell. The taste left much to be desired...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_10",
      "hash64": "23CD32958FE0FE34",
      "text": "How was it? I hope it was tasty.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_select_01",
      "hash64": "16F8CA5379943209",
      "text": "Uh, yeah, tasty...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_select_02",
      "hash64": "16F8C75379942CF0",
      "text": "Well, to be honest...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_11",
      "hash64": "23CD33958FE0FFE7",
      "text": "Sorry. I shouldn’t have asked you that. Heh...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_12",
      "hash64": "23CD34958FE1019A",
      "text": "I’m athletic and all, but I don’t know the first\\nthing about making good food...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_13",
      "hash64": "23CD35958FE1034D",
      "text": "as your honest reaction just reminded me.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_14",
      "hash64": "23CD2E958FE0F768",
      "text": "Well, uh...see you later. Enjoy your sore muscles\\ntomorrow.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_a_system_03",
      "hash64": "5CE629AF22FB8F38",
      "text": "You became slightly closer with Ms. Dendra!",
      "flags": 0,
